{% layout 'theme' %}

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: 100vw !important;
    max-width: 100vw !important;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    padding: 60px 0 !important;
    position: relative;
    left: 50%;
    right: 50%;
    margin-left: -50vw !important;
    margin-right: -50vw !important;
    background: #ffffff !important;
  }
  .about-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .about-title {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .about-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .about-card {
    background: #f8f6f3;
    padding: 40px 36px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }
  .about-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .about-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .about-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-card .highlight {
    color: #0066ff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .what-matters {
    background: #f8f6f3;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .what-matters h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .what-matters-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .what-matters-item {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .what-matters-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .what-matters-item .icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: block;
  }
  .what-matters-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .what-matters-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .what-matters-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-title { font-size: 2rem; }
    .about-card { padding: 28px 20px; }
    .what-matters { padding: 32px 20px; }
  }
</style>

<section class="about-page">
  <div class="about-container">
    <h1 class="about-title">About Us</h1>
    <p class="about-subtitle">
      DERMALIFT™ was created with a simple belief: effective facial lifting should be accessible, non-invasive, and rooted in real technology — not trends. We combine clinically inspired innovation with everyday usability to help people feel confident in their skin, naturally and consistently.
    </p>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-card">
        <h2>🚀 Our Mission</h2>
        <p>At <span class="highlight">DERMALIFT™</span>, our mission is to empower people to take control of their skin health through safe, effective, and non-invasive facial sculpting technology.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">We believe visible results don't require needles, surgery, or expensive clinic visits. Instead, real transformation comes from consistency, intelligent design, and technology that works with your body — not against it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card">
        <h2>👁️ Our Vision</h2>
        <p>At <span class="highlight">DERMALIFT™</span>, our vision is to redefine how people experience facial lifting and skin rejuvenation — by blending science, simplicity, and long-term results.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">We envision a future where at-home beauty technology is trusted, transparent, and backed by real function — not hype. Where skincare goes beyond the surface and supports the underlying structure that keeps skin firm, sculpted, and healthy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="what-matters">
      <h2>What Truly Matters</h2>
      <div class="what-matters-list">
        <div class="what-matters-item">
          <span class="icon">🧬</span>
          <h3>Science-Backed</h3>
          <p>Clinically inspired technology that delivers real, measurable results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-matters-item">
          <span class="icon">🧘</span>
          <h3>Non-Invasive</h3>
          <p>No needles, no surgery — just gentle, effective facial sculpting at home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-matters-item">
          <span class="icon">🌱</span>
          <h3>Consistent Care</h3>
          <p>Designed for daily use, supporting long-term skin health and firmness.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
